      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>改进</h3>
        <ul>
        <li>支持 GPT-6.1 Terra、GPT-6 Cyber、GPT-6 Rosalind 和 GPT-Rosalind Discovery 的 Token 费用估算。</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>安装提示</h3>
        <ul>
        <li>安装包已使用 Developer ID 签名，尚未完成 Apple 公证。首次打开时，macOS 可能要求手动确认。</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Improvements</h3>
        <ul>
        <li>Added token cost estimates for GPT-6.1 Terra, GPT-6 Cyber, GPT-6 Rosalind, and GPT-Rosalind Discovery.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Installation</h3>
        <ul>
        <li>This build is Developer ID signed and has not been notarized by Apple. macOS may require manual approval on first launch.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
